  "label": "Violence/Barbarism Claims",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references the stereotype that Muslims are associated with violence and barbarism, even when the religion itself is peaceful. This stereotype is used to justify the violent imagery and to frame the religion as being under attack, even though the religion itself is peaceful. The meme uses this stereotype to provoke strong emotional reactions and to delegitimize criticism of the religion by equating it with violence.",
